### lin-spring-order-management 全场景调试脚本（VS Code REST Client）
### 前置：cd lin-spring-order-management && docker compose up -d，然后依次启动 4 个服务：
###   order-service (8081) / inventory-service (8082) / payment-service (8083) / notification-service (8084)

@order = http://localhost:8081
@inventory = http://localhost:8082
@payment = http://localhost:8083

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 0. 登录换取 JWT（模拟登录：任意 customerId + name）
# @name login
POST {{order}}/api/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId": 1, "name": "Alice"}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 1. 产品目录（首次查库，之后命中 Redis 缓存）
GET {{inventory}}/api/v1/products

### 单个产品（重复执行两次，inventory-service 日志第二次应显示 cache hit）
GET {{inventory}}/api/v1/products/101

### 调价（驱逐缓存 → 下一次读取新价；订单价格在创建时快照，不受影响）
PUT {{inventory}}/api/v1/products/101/price
Content-Type: application/json

{"unitPrice": 84.90}

### 权威库存视图（Redis 不参与库存正确性）
GET {{inventory}}/api/v1/inventory/410

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. 场景 A：正常下单 → 预留 → 支付成功 → CONFIRMED
# 先确认支付渠道为 SUCCESS
PUT {{payment}}/api/v1/admin/payment-mode
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode": "SUCCESS"}

### 下单（携带 Idempotency-Key，返回 202）
# @name createA
POST {{order}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-A-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {"productId": 101, "quantity": 2},
    {"productId": 205, "quantity": 1}
  ]
}

###
@orderA = {{createA.response.body.orderId}}

### 幂等重放：同键同负载 → duplicate=true，orderId 相同
POST {{order}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-A-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {"productId": 101, "quantity": 2},
    {"productId": 205, "quantity": 1}
  ]
}

### 幂等冲突：同键不同负载 → 409（不静默返回无关订单）
POST {{order}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-A-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {"productId": 101, "quantity": 5}
  ]
}

### 轮询订单状态（PENDING → PAYMENT_PENDING → CONFIRMED，outbox 轮询约 0.5s 一拍）
GET {{order}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderA}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 订单详情（含服务端快照单价）
GET {{order}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderA}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 支付记录视角
GET {{payment}}/api/v1/payments/order/{{orderA}}

### CONFIRMED 后库存被最终扣减（reserved 归零）
GET {{inventory}}/api/v1/inventory/101

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. 场景 B：防超卖（product 410 库存仅 1 件，一次买 2 → FAILED）
# @name createB
POST {{order}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-B-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"items": [{"productId": 410, "quantity": 2}]}

###
@orderB = {{createB.response.body.orderId}}

### 状态应为 FAILED（库存不足，未预留任何商品）
GET {{order}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderB}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. 场景 C：支付失败 → 释放库存
PUT {{payment}}/api/v1/admin/payment-mode
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode": "FAILURE"}

# @name createC
POST {{order}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-C-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"items": [{"productId": 520, "quantity": 1}]}

###
@orderC = {{createC.response.body.orderId}}

### 状态应推进到 PAYMENT_FAILED，且库存已释放（available 恢复）
GET {{order}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderC}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{inventory}}/api/v1/inventory/520

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. 场景 D：支付超时 → UNKNOWN → 对账发现"其实已扣款" → CONFIRMED
PUT {{payment}}/api/v1/admin/payment-mode
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode": "TIMEOUT_THEN_SUCCESS"}

# @name createD
POST {{order}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-D-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"items": [{"productId": 301, "quantity": 3}]}

###
@orderD = {{createD.response.body.orderId}}

### 先观察到 PAYMENT_UNKNOWN（支付渠道 2s 超时后置为 UNKNOWN，等 3~10s 再查）
GET {{order}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderD}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 约 10~20 秒后对账任务查询渠道真实结果 → CONFIRMED
GET {{order}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderD}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 支付记录视角（status=COMPLETED，chargeId 带 reconciled 前缀）
GET {{payment}}/api/v1/payments/order/{{orderD}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. 场景 E：超时 → 对账发现"渠道未扣款" → PAYMENT_FAILED + 释放库存
PUT {{payment}}/api/v1/admin/payment-mode
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode": "TIMEOUT_THEN_FAIL"}

# @name createE
POST {{order}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-E-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"items": [{"productId": 301, "quantity": 1}]}

###
@orderE = {{createE.response.body.orderId}}

### 约 15~20 秒后：PAYMENT_FAILED，且 inventory 301 库存已回补
GET {{order}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderE}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{inventory}}/api/v1/inventory/301

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. 场景 F：取消已 CONFIRMED 的订单 → 自动退款（补偿是新的财务操作）
PUT {{payment}}/api/v1/admin/payment-mode
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode": "SUCCESS"}

# @name createF
POST {{order}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-F-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"items": [{"productId": 520, "quantity": 2}]}

###
@orderF = {{createF.response.body.orderId}}

### 等待 CONFIRMED 后取消
POST {{order}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderF}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 支付记录应出现 refundAmount / refundId
GET {{payment}}/api/v1/payments/order/{{orderF}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. 场景 G：取消未支付订单（PENDING/PAYMENT_PENDING 可取消）+ 越权防护
# @name createG
POST {{order}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-G-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"items": [{"productId": 101, "quantity": 1}]}

###
@orderG = {{createG.response.body.orderId}}

### 立即取消（PENDING → CANCELLED，库存预留将被释放）
POST {{order}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderG}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 用另一个客户的 token 查看别人的订单 → 404（不泄露存在性）
# @name loginBob
POST {{order}}/api/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId": 2, "name": "Bob"}

###
GET {{order}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderG}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBob.response.body.accessToken}}

### 未认证访问 → 401
GET {{order}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderG}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 9. 订单历史（分页）
GET {{order}}/api/v1/customers/1/orders?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 10. 补货（重跑防超卖演示前把 410 补回 1 件）
POST {{inventory}}/api/v1/admin/restock
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId": 410, "quantity": 1}

### 恢复支付模式
PUT {{payment}}/api/v1/admin/payment-mode
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode": "SUCCESS"}
